      <p style={{ margin: 0, color: "var(--muted)", fontSize: "0.88rem", lineHeight: 1.75 }}>A seller who asks for a bank transfer, sends a code by direct message, or offers a price far below Microsoft's list fee. Vouchers are non-transferable, so a code from a stranger may not work. Buy from the official Udemy page or Microsoft directly.</p>
    </div>
